  "term": "Anorexia Nervosa",
  "definition": "Anorexia nervosa is an eating disorder marked by loss or lack of appetite, major weight loss, and refusal to maintain a minimally normal weight. It also involves an intense fear of becoming overweight and a disturbed body image.",
